{"about_the_game":"<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Suggested Steam Description</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Step up to the spot and feel the penalty shootout tension!</strong><br>This sequel to the classic penalty-kick football game adds more leagues, more teams, and a sharper competition system\u2014now on PC.</p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>360 teams across 12 fantasy leagues</strong>.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Two-phase tournaments</strong> \u2013 Fight through the group stage and survive the knockout rounds to lift the trophy.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Simple, precise mouse controls</strong> \u2013<br><i>Shoot:</i> move the mouse to aim, hold the button, release to strike.<br><i>Save:</i> As goalkeeper, simply click the spot where you want your keeper to dive..</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Smart AI goalkeepers</strong> \u2013 Don\u2019t get predictable; mix up your shots to stay ahead.</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Stay cool, read the striker\u2019s eyes, and kick like a pro. Can you handle the pressure of the ultimate penalty shootout?</p>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/4051880?t=1760954127","background_raw":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4051880/8892dbb79be0b797b5b221c348a12e3c63cf2f2a/page_bg_raw.jpg?t=1760954127","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4051880/f785a58a0453fb6c98e556e814b79bc6e0855d92/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1760954127","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4051880/f785a58a0453fb6c98e556e814b79bc6e0855d92/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1760954127","categories":[{"description":"Single-player","id":2},{"description":"Mouse Only Option","id":76},{"description":"Family Sharing","id":62}],"content_descriptors":{"ids":[],"notes":null},"detailed_description":"<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Sugge